<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Horses In A Dream</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Sundiver</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">0WYthlQT3guF0c0gZyXTP2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.890" end="00:33.890">Lanolin hills that move me to your will, exposed to the soil.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.330" end="00:47.330">Everything is moving in slow motion got a feeling I could die for it, die for it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.950" end="00:54.300">Waves that leap up to the surface, percolate &amp; burst &amp; let me lie on it, lie on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.300" end="01:02.300">Imbue me with your love, share me with desperate blood</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.440" end="01:15.990">Like horses dancing through the fields</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.990" end="01:20.820">Through water dark as lye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.820" end="01:27.900">You start to multiply and soak me to the bone until I’m yours.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.900" end="01:35.900">Everything is moving in slow motion got a feeling I could die for it, die for it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.700" end="01:42.960">Waves that leap up to the surface, percolate &amp; burst &amp; let me lie on it, lie on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.960" end="01:46.960">it.</p></div></body></tt>